#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hcsr04.rst:28
#: 17a1dcdcba2c465b8a198934d6b19436 52634d9f246f413db43c69ac9a79dd33
#: 84286a0b3f984281afda4365bd5c14f5 84401c18e2f546f7b1e204b117897442
#: e8db3c48cc2345f7a9af8ad0d40d479b
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = Enter GPIO number for pin "
"attached to HC-SRO4 \"Trigger\" pin. For example, on PixHawk with "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` = 4, AUX6 (GPIO 55) could be used here, and AUX5 (GPIO54) "
"could be used below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = 输入连接到 HC-SR04「Trigger」引脚的 GPIO "
"编号。例如，在 Pixhawk 上 ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` = 4 时，可在此使用 AUX6（GPIO "
"55），AUX5（GPIO54）可用于下方。"

